ODOO041 Translatable term contains variables. Interpolate outside the translation call
 --> ODOO041.py:1:1
  |
1 | _("Hello %s" % name)
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
2 | _("Hello {}".format(name))
3 | _("Hello %s") % name
  |

ODOO041 Translatable term contains variables. Interpolate outside the translation call
 --> ODOO041.py:2:1
  |
1 | _("Hello %s" % name)
2 | _("Hello {}".format(name))
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
3 | _("Hello %s") % name
4 | _("Plain text")
  |
